Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.85,0:00:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, okay, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A toast to this gathering\Nof friends new and old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With everyone here, we'd\Nbe an amazing party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we would. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should raid the boss on floor 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm down with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do. I get to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.26,0:01:12.19,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Toomawari bakari shita yo ne kimi to aruiteta
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.26,0:01:12.19,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The two of us seem to always take the long way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.95,0:01:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.73,0:01:22.62,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Nani ga okite mo heiki sou omoeta yo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.73,0:01:22.62,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I could believe that we'd be okay, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the day, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.62,0:01:34.55,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Ano hi ano basho de toki wo kasaneru made
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.62,0:01:34.55,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}On that day at that place,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.55,0:01:39.22,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Shirazu ni ita sekai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.55,0:01:39.22,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}there's a world unknown.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.22,0:01:50.86,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Meguri meguru kisetsu ga mienai kokoro mitashiteku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.22,0:01:50.86,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The cycles of the seasons fulfill hearts unseen.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.86,0:02:01.45,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Itsumo sono egao ga senaka wo osu kara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.86,0:02:01.45,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Your smile always propels me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.45,0:02:13.17,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Kako ni umorete kieta futari kawashita kotoba ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.45,0:02:13.17,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The words we've shared that've been buried by the past
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.17,0:02:27.64,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1557)}Ima mo mabushii zutto chikaku ni kimi wo kanjiteru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.17,0:02:27.64,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1557)}Shine brightly even now, as I can always feel you nearby.
