Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.04,0:02:55.63,Android,,0,0,0,,{\fscy128.16\fscx116.51\blur1.5\an7\c&HA69FCA&\2c&HEDF1EC&\pos(92.87,781.74)\fay-0.42\frz332}Yuuki-san, \NKonno-san's condition has deteriorated. \NCan you come immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 40 minutes ago, her heart\Nstopped, but only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got it going with\Ndefibrillation and meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it happens again…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She seemed fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, ever since January,\Nwhen you first came to visit her,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her condition's been touch and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and for these last three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all been stunned by how\NYuki's managed to hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't beat this,\Nbut she keeps fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She keeps on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 15 years Yuki's spent on this\Nplanet have been one long battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The HIV is only part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's also been fighting the harsh reality\Nof her situation while in treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt the\Nclinical trials with the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Medicuboid caused her an\Nunimaginable amount of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And still, somehow Yuki keeps hanging on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.55,0:04:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, we should\Nlet her get some rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ultimate Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take her hand. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, can she use the Medicuboid now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, well, wouldn't she want\Nto spend her last moments here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants to go back one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Doctor, let her\Nuse the Medicuboid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to take about\Na minute to boot up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going next door to\Nlog in with the Amusphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:06:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to see you again,\Nbecause I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I almost\Nforgot about it. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you wanted to give me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, I still gotta make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.53,0:06:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.37,0:06:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so weak all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not in any pain or anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a little tired is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll feel better if you rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.73,0:07:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my original sword skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Yuki, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave it a cool name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother's Rosario.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And someday, when I leave this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to pass it\Non to someone before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sword will live on\Nuntil the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.85,0:08:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, you got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all here to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get to the other\Nside, wait for us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't take too long, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get there too soon, I'll be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't even try to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.71,0:08:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Nori, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We promised we'd be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.81,0:09:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all those fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to let them know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the strongest, most powerful\NSwordsman this world's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will never be anyone\Nelse like you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let you go\Nwithout saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all praying for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That your next journey will be\Nto a place as wonderful as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:11:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this whole time I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I was born to die what the heck
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was the point of me even Being born I\Nnever made anything or gave anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to anyone all I did was waste drugs\Nand hog that Machine and cause
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trouble for everyone if all I get to\Ndo is suffer and disappear in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be better to just disappear right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now I used to always think why am I alive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I stick around for\Nthis long but you know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what after all this time\NI think I know why now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might not have done much. But\NI'm glad I got to live. Cause
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everything, these last few\Nmoments—they're the best ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by all\Nmy friends And I got to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end my journey In the\Narms of someone I love
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki. I promise I will\Nsee you again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in some other place\Nsome other world I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how, but I'll find\Nyou and then we can sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and talk and you can\Ntell me where you've been
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.99,0:13:08.99,Service,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\frz355.3\fscx17\fscy17\fax-0.01\pos(1339.2,928.8)\c&H86665D&}Konno Yuuki\N Memorial Service
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.99,0:13:11.45,Service,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fax-0.09\move(873,483,872.895,823.89,27,2446)\frz0}Konno Yuuki\N Memorial Service
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,¶¶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never made anything, or\Ngave anything to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You carved it deep into my\Nheart, and it'll always be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:13:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that you, Siune?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to finally meet\Nyou in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Sheen Ahn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nice to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Asuna Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like meeting for the first time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just this month I got\Nthe all clear from my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doctor and was discharged\Nfrom the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're doing better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The type of disease I have is\Ncalled acute lymphocytic leukemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was about three years\Nago when I developed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The side effects from the\Nmedicine were so horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to die rather\Nthan keep suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whenever I saw Yuuki, I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's this kid, and she's handling her\Nsituation better than I'm handling mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Around February, they started\Ncutting back on the meds I was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:15:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought, this is it, and\NI braced myself for the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then a week ago, the day after\NYuki died, my doctor came in and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,congratulations, you're\Nin complete remission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next thing I knew, I was being discharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I barely had a chance to process the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the truth is, it\Nstill hasn't sunk in yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like, I should feel awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem fair that I'm\Nstill here and Yuki's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki and Ron, Clovis and Merida, we\Npromised we'd stick together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our lives are like vessels,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.65,0:15:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we carry the teachings of\Nthe ones who've passed in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the longest time, I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scared of telling someone\Nhow I really felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and scared of finding out how they felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I learned from Yuki that\Nthat was no way for me to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't even try to reach\Nout, nothing would ever change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She taught me how to be strong, and\NI want to share that with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive, I'll pass on what\NI learned from her to everyone I meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I see her again, I want to tell\Nher about all the people she's helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I'll pay her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we're all so\Ngrateful for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd been so worried about Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was carrying a heavy burden\Non those little shoulders of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then you showed up, and\Nsomething in her changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you were together, Yuki seemed\Nlike she was really having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was like a forgetful bird\Nwho remembered how to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:17:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she flew up and up, and\Nnow she's out of our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, June's also doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The medication he's on\Nseems to be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me it feels like Yuki's telling all\Nof us it's still too soon to join her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means it's\Ngoing to be a while yet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before the sleeping\Nknights get back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time you're taking me in as a member\Nand I don't want to hear any arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we're not interrupting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, do you guys\Nknow each other? Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.11,0:17:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to steal my ideas about\Nthat communications pod I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm interested in its possibilities\Nin full-dive medical tech,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we've been emailing back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the medicuboid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to phase it out,\Nor were the trials successful?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.53,0:17:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were extremely successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now we have enough data\Nto proceed to the next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon patients all over\Nthe country will have...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I didn't say this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mizan, congratulations on your recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Yuki would be\Nthrilled at the news too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saying so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And congratulations on the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to know what you learned\Nfrom Yuki will be used to help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes me happy. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki was the first person\Nto test the medicuboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and her name will always be remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she were here, she'd\Nget an award for her help,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with the benefactor\Nwho made it all possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing Yuki, she wouldn't be\Ntoo thrilled at getting an award.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd say, what's the point in\Nhaving it if I can't eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Doctor, you just mentioned the\NMedicuboid had some kind of benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said the\Ngovernment was paying for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:18:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, yes, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the initial designs were given\Nto us for free from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly,\NI think her name was Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rank Kojiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.97,0:19:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met her once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in fact, she was taking care of\NHeathcliff's body while he was diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was his head researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She helped him develop\Nfull dive technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Medicuboid's design.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who invented it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to show you what
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.16,0:20:11.00,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k21}Ma{\k20}chi {\k40}a{\k24}ka{\k57}ri {\k27}te{\k28}ra{\k30}shi{\k100}ta {\k19}ni{\k21}gi{\k20}ya{\k22}ka {\k21}na {\k45}wa{\k25}ra{\k32}i {\k27}go{\k23}e {\k83}to
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.16,0:20:11.00,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The street lights cast a glow on cheerful laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.00,0:20:15.63,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k51\fad(200,200)}Ro{\k44}ji{\k41}u{\k25}ra {\k39}no {\k49}a{\k52}shi{\k23}a{\k138}to
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.00,0:20:15.63,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And footprints in the back-alley
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.05,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k30\fad(200,200)}Tsu{\k26}ta{\k18}e {\k27}ta{\k34}i {\k23}o{\k39}mo{\k21}i {\k93}wa
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.05,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wonder how much you understood of the feelings
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.05,0:20:22.22,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k29\fad(200,200)}Do{\k20}re {\k19}da{\k20}ke {\k22}to{\k41}do{\k22}i {\k59}tan {\k24}da{\k59}rou
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.05,0:20:22.22,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've always wanted to convey to you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will always be able to make sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.22,0:20:28.05,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k39\fad(200,200)}I{\k28}tsu{\k30}mo {\k28}fu{\k43}ri {\k25}mu{\k32}i{\k21}te {\k46}ta{\k40}shi{\k38}ka{\k46}me{\k168}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.22,0:20:28.05,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I always turn around to you and make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.47,0:20:32.85,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k15\fad(200,200)}I{\k27}tsu {\k37}da{\k38}tte {\k26}ma{\k22}yo{\k19}wa{\k54}zu
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.47,0:20:32.85,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Because no matter how I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be able to see you. I will be able
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.85,0:20:43.03,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k28\fad(200,200)}Ki{\k18}mi {\k38}wa {\k43}ki{\k43}tto {\k63}don{\k19}na {\k20}bo{\k21}ku {\k26}mo {\k54}oi{\k61}ka{\k64}ke{\k161}te {\k27}ku{\k14}re{\k65}ru {\k61}ka{\k192}ra
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.85,0:20:43.03,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I believe you'd always chase after me without any hesitation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to see
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.65,0:20:56.12,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k35\fad(200,200)}Ji{\k23}tto {\k18}mi{\k22}tsu{\k21}me{\k81}ta {\k80}ki{\k84}mi {\k74}no {\k112}hi{\k22}to{\k24}mi {\k97}ni {\k16}u{\k44}tsu{\k23}tta {\k38}bo{\k26}ku {\k56}ga {\k22}i{\k61}ki{\k17}ta {\k42}shi{\k21}ru{\k191}shi
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.65,0:20:56.12,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}When I gazed at your eyes, I saw the proof that I've lived
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I see when I'm in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:21:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear the sound of my voice.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.13,0:21:03.13,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k29\fad(200,200)}Na{\k15}n{\k21}do {\k20}mo {\k82}to{\k82}gi{\k74}re {\k90}sou{\k102}na {\k23}ko{\k26}do{\k38}u
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.13,0:21:03.13,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Whenever my heartbeat was about to stop,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.13,0:21:07.30,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k60\fad(200,200)}Tsu{\k22}yo{\k37}ku {\k22}tsu{\k40}yo{\k21}ku {\k41}na{\k16}ra{\k27}shi{\k130}ta
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.13,0:21:07.30,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You made it ring out very, very loudly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear the
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.64,0:21:14.35,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,516)}Kyou {\k56}wo {\k38}ko{\k25}e{\k87}te {\k40}mi{\k24}ta{\k36}in{\k396}da
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.64,0:21:14.35,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,516)}I want to go far beyond today
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sound of my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need any help unpacking all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but only if you're not busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.97,0:21:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, ain't she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you a little gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, you shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you having fun hanging\Nout here with everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the cherry blossoms are pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's too bad they're almost gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, there's plenty\Nleft, you spoilsport.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're here with Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.63,0:21:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.07,0:21:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe we\Nmade it happen that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for this, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kirito, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, if you want to thank someone,\Nthank Yuki for helping me develop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.15,0:22:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.63,0:22:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real world and the virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the closer they came together,\Nthe better the future would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.21,0:22:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like, the more the lines\Nbetween these worlds blur,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the more everyone gets\Nsucked into its darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.09,0:22:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but a lot of people\Nhave been helped by it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I wish I knew\Nwhat Kayaba's master plan was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's our job as\Nsurvivors of SAO to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're overthinking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.27,0:22:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I want to find\Nout more than ever now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after everything that's happened,\Nmy curiosity's got me hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, a part of me\Nthinks I'm being played here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.89,0:22:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's\Ngoing to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.55,0:23:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is, I want\Nto be with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want you to be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stick by you even if you\Nmove halfway across the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.57,0:23:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said anything about moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.05,0:23:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to take Mila.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lovebirds!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit making out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.23,0:23:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to take a photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.23,0:23:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

